~ start
solider_one: Astryn! Perfect timing.
solider_one: Would you and your team like to run a practice bout before the real fight?
- Yes, let's spar! => practice_fight_accept
- Not right now => practice_fight_decline

~ practice_fight_accept
solider_one: Good — get your team ready. This one's just for practice, so don't hold back!
do speaker.start_practice_fight()
=> END

~ practice_fight_decline
solider_one: Fair enough. Come find me whenever you want to spar.
=> END
